# PR 6h2 (STAGE_6_PLAN 5.4, F7, MODULE_MAPPING X7, #12): fleet.complete_service_order is module-local; Inventory issues
# the kit on ServiceOrderCompleted through inventory.issue_service_kit (holds consumed, the rest up to the stock, ordered
# locks, idempotent per line) and Fleet's consumer of ServiceKitIssued writes qty_issued (Inventory migration
# ServiceKitIssue, db/sql/inventory/0009; Fleet migration ServiceKitIssueGrants, db/sql/fleet/0008).
